 "review": {
  "management_type_reason": "NC State・種: 地下茎で aggressively に広がると明記（地下茎によるものなので種の記述を品種に当てる）。MBG・品種には侵略的との文がなく（照合では弱い扱い）、根拠は種の1文なので 中。おぎはら楽天: 花後に花茎を切る程度",
  "management_type_quote": "It can spread aggressively.",
  "management_type_by_matching": "E 隔離推奨型",
  "heat_west_only": "弱",
  "muggy_west_only": "弱",
  "heat_muggy_west_evidence": "[おぎはら/品種] 耐暑性；強\n[おぎはら 強・欧米 弱] おぎはら自身も楽天のページで蒸れ・暖地の日かげの注意を書いているので、中 にした\n[おぎはら楽天/品種] 日照 寒冷地: 日向〜やや半日陰／暖地: 半日陰（西日 × 相当）\n[MBG/品種] Prefers part shade in hot summer climates.\n[MBG/品種] However, plants do not perform well in the hot and humid summer climates of the deep South in areas where night temperatures consistently remain above 70 degrees F.\n[食い違い] 欧米の文献（品種の記述）は 弱 相当。おぎはら植物園の値を採った",
  "spread_evidence": "[地下茎 3／NC State・種] It can spread aggressively（読み直し）\n[こぼれ種 1／NC State・種] it will self-seed and spread by rhizomes（読み直し）\n[こぼれ種 1／NC State・種] To propagate this plant, divide its clumps every three to four years in the fall, or with adequate growing conditions, it will self-seed and spread by rhizomes itself.\n[地下茎 3／NC State・種] It can spread aggressively.\n[地下茎の食い違い] MBG は 1 相当、stauden.de は 2 相当\n[増え方] こぼれ種・地下茎の段階に合わせて直した（前：株立ち、ランナー）",
  "mixing_evidence": "地下茎かこぼれ種が 3（こぼれ種・地下茎の根拠の列）\n[NC State・種] It can spread aggressively.",
  "silhouette_evidence": "[MBG・品種] Glossy, leathery, heart-shaped, dark green leaves (to 4” long) with toothed margins form basal rosettes.",
